  "details": "The games hiccups on Avatar load have become incredibly big where my game will freeze for a second or two at a time when before this barely happened at all.\n\nWhen entering a world with a lot of people in close proximity this is just stutter hell.\n\nThis happened with the recent OB patch that happened last weekend which introduced the keyboard.\n\nThis has nothing to do with any SteamVR version as another post suggested as Ive tried the prev built and the current built of SteamVR and there was no performance impact.\n\nThe worlds were rather low performance too.\n\nJust to further drive out the point, I have most avatars hidden beyond 80mb, and most only load partially and Ive never had these many hiccups in over a year, especially not in the Unity 6 Open beta which was working way better than the default version.",
